<section id="contacto" class="relative py-28 border-t border-line overflow-hidden">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0">
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[700px] h-[700px] bg-brand-red/15 rounded-full blur-[160px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <p class="font-mono text-brand-red text-sm tracking-[0.3em] mb-6" data-reveal>// HABLEMOS</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-7xl text-white leading-[0.95] mb-10" data-reveal>
      ¿QUERÉS RENOVAR<br />TU NEGOCIO?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-smoke max-w-lg mx-auto mb-10" data-reveal style="transition-delay:120ms">
      Contanos tu proyecto y te asesoramos para encontrar la solución de cartelería
      que mejor represente tu marca.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4" data-reveal style="transition-delay:220ms">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/5493512288814"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="bg-brand-red hover:bg-brand-redLight text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 animate-floatY"
      >
        Charlemos por WhatsApp
      </a>
      <a
        href="mailto:contacto@zipgrafica.com.ar"
        class="border border-line hover:border-brand-red text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        Escribinos un email
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>